    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Imprisonment obligation reduced for certain federal offences.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "Section 17a of the Principal Act is amended to reduce imprisonment for certain federal offences.";
